  "title": "习近平在浙江考察调研",
  "date": "2020-03-30 07:43:02",
  "author": "新华社",
  "editor": "(责编：常雪梅                     )",
  "article": "<div class=\"d2txt_con clearfix\">\n<p></p><p style=\"text-indent: 2em;\">\n习近平总书记29日在浙江考察调研。当天下午，他先后来到宁波舟山港穿山港区码头、北仑大碶高端汽配模具园区，了解港口和园区企业复工复产情况。（记者：杨维汉、朱基钗）</p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/43/16145756432960216695.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/30/14401847429536905206.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/4/11667877086471216076.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/76/10338564774548333716.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/77/430325689562211749.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/75/3232394587181150027.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/85/11851838960939135713.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/46/15618707336479250218.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/19/3758680010622643575.jpg\"/></p>\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"text-align:center\">\n<img alt=\"\" src=\"http://www.people.com.cn/mediafile/pic/20200330/67/9295480855393191107.jpg\"/></p>\n</div>",
  "text": [
    "习近平总书记29日在浙江考察调研。当天下午，他先后来到宁波舟山港穿山港区码头、北仑大碶高端汽配模具园区，了解港口和园区企业复工复产情况。（记者：杨维汉、朱基钗）"
